import ImbalancedChen.Part5OriginalH430RankTwoFrontierConverse

/-!
P5.6 / h34: exact finite tagged rank-two incidence and capacity ledger
for the ACTUAL original U3/U4 selected quotient source.

Each retained original (tag,p,q) receipt chooses ONE of its genuine
Rosser-retained prime divisors ell of q. The key is (tag,p,ell), NOT q:
all receipts with a common key compete for one representative slot.
We partition signed source weights by literal key fibres, split off
exactly one representative PER KEY, and keep every additional q
receipt as an explicit unassigned residual. The key itself is a
bookkeeping key, NOT a proved full/selected/inherited history owner.

The choice is finite/classical and neither changes historical Q
nor creates a new rank-two state for each q. Each actual chosen factor
is linked back to the literal firstExitDepthFrontier 2 with real
sign and product mass. No factor is assumed to be equal to q, no
cross-tag Q equality, no positive Euler-exit payment is asserted.

SOURCE ONLY / UNCOMPILED / UNEVALUATED / FULL H34 OPEN.
-/

namespace ImbalancedChen.Part5OriginalH430TaggedRankTwoFibreCapacity

noncomputable section
open scoped Classical BigOperators
open Part5OriginalH430TaggedArithmeticReceivers
open Part5OriginalH430OriginalSecondFactorWindow
open Part5OriginalH430PhysicalSelectedRootQFibres
open Part5OriginalH430ActualRootStageReceipts
